    (text "RELEASE BLOCKER - CONNECTOR POLARITY\nCurrent carrier assumption: J1 pin 1 = VIN_RAW, pin 2 = GND, pin 3 = SDA, pin 4 = SCL.\nBackplane-prototype presently shows the power pins oppositely. Confirm physical mated contacts and drawing viewpoints,\nthen make symbol pins, footprint pads, net assignments, and notes consistent in every carrier/backplane project before fabrication."
